IMPORT prelude

-- Work Injury Compensation Act 2019 (Singapore) -- FIRST SCHEDULE, Tables A
-- and B: the multiplying factors.
--
-- Source: ../../registers/source-bundle/WICA2019.first-schedule-tables.txt,
-- recovered from WICA2019.pdf.
--
-- WHY THIS MODULE EXISTS, AND WHY IT IS SEPARATE. The first pass of this
-- encoding could not read these tables at all. The deposited WICA2019.txt loses
-- a value at every page break -- Table A runs "31 -> 122", then a bare "32" with
-- no factor, then "33 -> 121" -- because the extraction shifts the factors down
-- one row relative to the ages. Everything after the break is therefore wrong by
-- one row, silently.
--
-- pypdf's extraction of the same PDF does not shift them. The recovered tables
-- were checked two ways before being encoded: every age from 14 to 66 appears
-- exactly once in each table, and no factor rises as age rises. Both checks are
-- repeated as assertions in the cases file.
--
-- The factor depends on "the age on the NEXT BIRTHDAY of the deceased employee
-- AT THE TIME OF THE ACCIDENT" (paragraph 1(1)), not on the age at death and
-- not on the age when the claim is made.

§ `First Schedule -- the multiplying factors`

§§ `Table A -- death`

-- First Schedule paragraph 1(1). 53 rows, "14 and below" to "66 and above".
GIVEN `the age on the next birthday` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Table A factor` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 14 THEN 136
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 15 THEN 135
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 16 THEN 135
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 17 THEN 134
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 18 THEN 134
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 19 THEN 133
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 20 THEN 132
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 21 THEN 132
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 22 THEN 131
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 23 THEN 130
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 24 THEN 129
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 25 THEN 128
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 26 THEN 127
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 27 THEN 127
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 28 THEN 125
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 29 THEN 124
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 30 THEN 123
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 31 THEN 122
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 32 THEN 121
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 33 THEN 120
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 34 THEN 118
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 35 THEN 117
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 36 THEN 115
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 37 THEN 114
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 38 THEN 112
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 39 THEN 110
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 40 THEN 108
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 41 THEN 107
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 42 THEN 106
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 43 THEN 105
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 44 THEN 104
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 45 THEN 103
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 46 THEN 102
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 47 THEN 101
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 48 THEN 100
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 49 THEN 98
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 50 THEN 96
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 51 THEN 94
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 52 THEN 92
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 53 THEN 90
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 54 THEN 88
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 55 THEN 86
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 56 THEN 84
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 57 THEN 82
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 58 THEN 80
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 59 THEN 78
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 60 THEN 75
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 61 THEN 72
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 62 THEN 68
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 63 THEN 63
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 64 THEN 58
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 65 THEN 53
        OTHERWISE 48   -- 66 and above

§§ `Table B -- incapacity`

-- First Schedule paragraph 2(a), and through C also paragraph 3. 53 rows on the
-- same age bands as Table A, and every factor is higher: the Act values a
-- surviving incapacitated employee above a death.
GIVEN `the age on the next birthday` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Table B factor` IS
    BRANCH
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 14 THEN 181
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 15 THEN 180
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 16 THEN 179
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 17 THEN 178
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 18 THEN 178
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 19 THEN 177
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 20 THEN 176
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 21 THEN 175
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 22 THEN 174
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 23 THEN 173
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 24 THEN 172
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 25 THEN 170
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 26 THEN 169
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 27 THEN 168
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 28 THEN 167
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 29 THEN 165
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 30 THEN 164
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 31 THEN 162
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 32 THEN 160
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 33 THEN 159
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 34 THEN 157
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 35 THEN 155
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 36 THEN 153
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 37 THEN 151
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 38 THEN 149
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 39 THEN 146
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 40 THEN 144
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 41 THEN 142
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 42 THEN 140
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 43 THEN 138
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 44 THEN 136
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 45 THEN 134
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 46 THEN 132
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 47 THEN 130
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 48 THEN 128
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 49 THEN 126
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 50 THEN 124
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 51 THEN 122
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 52 THEN 120
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 53 THEN 118
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 54 THEN 116
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 55 THEN 114
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 56 THEN 111
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 57 THEN 108
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 58 THEN 105
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 59 THEN 102
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 60 THEN 99
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 61 THEN 96
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 62 THEN 92
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 63 THEN 87
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 64 THEN 82
        IF `the age on the next birthday` AT MOST 65 THEN 77
        OTHERWISE 72   -- 66 and above
